<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>Manifest Access Payment Required</title>
</head>
<body style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; color: #333;">
    <div style="max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px;">
        <h2 style="color: #2c3e50;">Manifest Access Payment Required</h2>
        
        <p>Dear {{ recipient.fullName ?? recipient.businessName }},</p>
        
        <p>A manifest has been uploaded and requires payment for access:</p>
        
        <div style="background-color: #f8f9fa; padding: 15px; border-left: 4px solid #007bff; margin: 20px 0;">
            <p><strong>Manifest Number:</strong> {{ manifest.manifestNumber }}</p>
            <p><strong>Vessel Name:</strong> {{ manifest.vesselName ?? 'N/A' }}</p>
            <p><strong>Voyage Number:</strong> {{ manifest.voyageNumber ?? 'N/A' }}</p>
            <p><strong>Required Payment:</strong> {{ amount|format_money('PHP') }}</p>
        </div>
        
        <p>Please submit your payment receipt through the OPTIMUS portal to access the manifest details.</p>
        
        <p style="margin-top: 30px;">
            <a href="{{ url('manifest_detail', {id: manifest.id}) }}" 
               style="background-color: #007bff; color: white; padding: 10px 20px; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 5px; display: inline-block;">
                View Manifest
            </a>
        </p>
        
        <hr style="margin: 30px 0; border: none; border-top: 1px solid #ddd;">
        
        <p style="font-size: 12px; color: #666;">
            This is an automated message from OPTIMUS Shipping Portal. Please do not reply to this email.
        </p>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
